  "description": "A resource-driven notable-date (holiday and observance) engine for .NET 8 and .NET 10. Calendars are declarative, importable documents - concepts, rules, calculation strategies, and adjustment and resolution policies - that the engine resolves into concrete occurrences for a territory and date range. Ships the calculation strategies, astronomical algorithms, range-resolution machinery, shared faith and civil catalogues, and working-day DateOnly/DateTime extensions; regional holiday data ships in the companion Bodu.Globalization.Calendar.<Region> packages.",
